等语气。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"},{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"4","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"알아봤어","audio":"/audio/382e5836d653b89d3f7b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e9e6266b8035d7c4","term":"누구","zh":"谁","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3","entryId":"62078","definition":"指不认识的人。","pronunciation":["누구"]},{"id":"dc94e1b99a1052b4","term":"속이다","zh":"骗，欺骗","audio":"/audio/dc94e1b99a1052b4c925.mp3","entryId":"15597","definition":"哄骗别人，使其相信虚假的东西为事实。","pronunciation":["소기다"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"斟酌","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"对于怎么做某事，自己决定或判断。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试，试图","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"表示试着做前面所指的行为。","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/0930c81053f1c4ad99fd.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.847,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15597","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":96,"sequenceScore":2.5723,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你想骗谁啊？我都已经查清楚了。","您好，您为什么向我们的员工投诉？","家里突然出了急事，所以昨天没能去参加聚会。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"o